From: WhaleOS <whaleos-dev@navercorp.com>
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] lxc.py: bind-mount camera HAL + gralloc overrides

generate_session_lxc_config() bind-mounts WhaleOS-provided drop-in
replacements for three container files when they exist on the host
(installed by sibling ebuilds):

  - /vendor/lib/camera.device@3.4-external-impl.so
    Replaced by the binary-patched copy from waydroid-camera-hal-fix
    so that ExternalCameraDeviceSession::configureV4l2StreamLocked()
    no longer rejects UVC MJPG frames that over-report buffer size
    (LG Sonix FHD Webcam et al.).

  - /vendor/lib/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so   (32-bit)
  - /vendor/lib64/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so (64-bit)
    Replaced by the rebuilt copies from waydroid-gralloc-fix, which
    contain three source-level fixes: a zero-stride fallback in
    cros_gralloc_driver::allocate(), a matching R8-2D reshape on both
    the import and the map side of gbm_mesa_bo_*(), and a lazy SW
    import when an unspecified-SW-mask buffer (e.g. JPEG output BLOB
    from the camera HAL) is first locked.  Together they make
    lockYCbCr() return valid y/cb/cr layouts for flexible YUV
    buffers, which the external camera HAL needs to write V4L2 frames
    into Surface buffers.

All three entries use optional bind so that a missing host file (i.e.
the corresponding fix-ebuild not installed yet) is silently skipped
instead of aborting session start.

--- a/tools/helpers/lxc.py
+++ b/tools/helpers/lxc.py
@@ -249,6 +249,23 @@
         raise OSError("Failed to bind userdata")
     make_entry("/usr/lib/waydroid/data/configs/init.waydroid.rc", "system/etc/init/init.waydroid.rc")
 
+    # WhaleOS: external camera HAL + gralloc overlays (see ebuilds
+    # waydroid-camera-hal-fix and waydroid-gralloc-fix).  Each entry is
+    # optional so an unbuilt component just falls back to the upstream
+    # Lineage-20 binary already inside the container image.
+    _cam_impl = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/vendor/lib/camera.device@3.4-external-impl.so"
+    if os.path.exists(_cam_impl):
+        make_entry(_cam_impl, "vendor/lib/camera.device@3.4-external-impl.so",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    _mgbm32 = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/vendor/lib/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so"
+    if os.path.exists(_mgbm32):
+        make_entry(_mgbm32, "vendor/lib/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+    _mgbm64 = "/usr/lib/waydroid/android-overlay/vendor/lib64/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so"
+    if os.path.exists(_mgbm64):
+        make_entry(_mgbm64, "vendor/lib64/libminigbm_gralloc_gbm_mesa.so",
+                   options="bind,create=file,optional 0 0")
+
     lxc_path = tools.config.defaults["lxc"] + "/waydroid"
     config_nodes_tmp_path = args.work + "/config_session"
     config_nodes = open(config_nodes_tmp_path, "w")
